OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start the day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some heavy, and
OL,7,Faccompanied by strong southerly winds.
OL,8,FSome brighter spells for a time later
OL,9,Fin the afternoon as rain turns
OL,10,Fshowery, but southwest to westerly
OL,11,Fgales develop.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStorm Boelo will bring gales
OL,14,For severe gales and frequent showers
OL,15,Fthrough the evening and overnight,
OL,16,Fthese showers heavy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
