OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStorm Boelo will bring severe
OL,6,Fgales and frequent heavy showers in
OL,7,Fthe morning. Winds gradually easing in
OL,8,Fafternoon with some bright spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping between further showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,12,Fand bright start Monday, soon turning
OL,13,Fwet and windy. Very windy on Tuesday
OL,14,Fwith showers, some heavy. Bright
OL,15,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,16,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
